    (uuid "5bc1f76c-a4f9-468f-9f39-d7e373d65cf1")
  )
  (text "LeRobot leader + follower arms, each on its own CH343 bus adapter and its own fused 5 V branch"
    (at 20.32 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a430f940-4c60-4d4c-9ed8-b1b49bb6082b")
  )
  (text "LEADER: F_LEADER 2 A, 20 AWG. Torque off (hand-guided). ~0.2 A typ, < 1 A peak (V1-doc). After K1 as requested."
    (at 20.32 86.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5a25902a-b874-4e1f-beee-93a60492dfb0")
  )
  (text "FOLLOWER: F_FOLLOWER 15 A, 14 AWG. ~1-2 A typ, ~6 A design, ~9 A peak at 5 V (V1-doc, verify on V2)."
    (at 20.32 91.44 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5f80015a-82a2-46b3-b12b-ac8490995f96")
  )
  (text "Voltage: V1 follower = 7.4 V STS3215 (trip 8.0 V) -> keep 5 V. A 12 V STS3215 variant would need a new rail (Q2, TBD)."
    (at 20.32 96.52 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fc56bbca-70e7-46c6-a30a-cbf79d9b262f")
  )
  (text "E-stop: K1 cuts EA75-5V input -> both arms limp. Follower falls under gravity: keep people clear of the arm envelope."
    (at 20.32 101.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "dc1ad605-46af-4120-9a84-e19ac704eff2")
  )
  (text "Bus 2 of each adapter unused (no-connect). USB to powered hub. Power return by its own wire to the star point."
    (at 20.32 106.68 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f0980719-0bb2-40e9-ba7f-8415e81bb424")
  )
  (text "Adapter feed via screw terminal. Vendor nominal input 9-12.6 V; V1 runs these adapters from 5 V successfully (V1-measured) - keep, verify."
    (at 20.32 157.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "001fe883-38d9-437d-839e-62829fbd041f")
  )
